                "scene": "home",
                "text": "First light. Aldren's horse is gone from the stable."
              },
              {
                "scene": "home",
                "text": "In the hall the sword of your forefathers hangs on its pegs.\nA red hand on the hilt; a note pinned beneath."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "choice": {
            "id": "sword",
            "title": "The Sword of Your Forefathers",
