                      "“I leave the sword of our forefathers. Do not take it. Do not come after me. — A.”"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "ending": {
                      "id": "gone_at_dawn",
                      "heading": "Gone at Dawn",
                      "next": "1.1",
                      "body": "Aldren rode out at first light. His sword stays on the wall.",
                      "frames": [
                        {
                          "scene": "home",
                          "text": "You leave the sword on its pegs.\nThen you go after him."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
